OL,3,GNEWSADriver error caused powerboat
OL,4,Acrash, coroner rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FDriver error contributed to a
OL,7,Fhigh-speed crash which killed a
OL,8,Fpowerboat racer, a coroner has
OL,9,Fconcluded.
OL,11,FBrett Duncan, of Martlesham Heath,
OL,12,FSuffolk, was travelling at 70mph
OL,13,F(113km/h) on Oulton Broad when he
OL,14,Fstruck Jaki Beech's houseboat on 24
OL,15,FJuly last year.
OL,17,FSuffolk Coroner's Court heard the
OL,18,F51-year-old was not wearing a kill cord
OL,19,Fto cut power to his hydroplane's engine
OL,20,Fwhen he struck the boat, which
OL,21,Fwithstood the impact due to its steel
OL,22,Fframe.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
