OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F379A1793118373
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADriver error caused powerboat
OL,4,Acrash, coroner rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Dr Daniel Sharpstone said
OL,7,F"there was nothing to suggest Brett was
OL,8,Fnothing other than his usual self" on
OL,9,Fthe day, but ruled "on balance of
OL,10,Fprobabilities, driver error contributed
OL,11,Fto the collision".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
